<title>UK: BayerHypo adds 100 mln guilders to Dec 2002 bond. [CORRECTED 12:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>BayerHypo adds 100 mln guilders to Dec 2002 bond. [CORRECTED 12:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 300 million guilders from 200 million guilders, lead manager ING Barings said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.375     MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.46    PAY DATE   *14.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.91    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    AMST	YIELD	 5.18</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 5-50-1M   SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p>(Corrects S&amp;P rating to A+ from AA+.)</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.55	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.75 PCT DSL DUE SEPTEMBER 2002</p>
<p> NOTES	*PLUS 104 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
